# Trivy ignore list — justify EVERY entry
# Format: <CVE-ID>
# Each entry MUST have a comment line above explaining justification + expiry.
#
# This file can ONLY suppress by vulnerability ID. To suppress a whole package,
# do not paste its CVE list here — it goes stale as soon as a new one is
# published. Add a rule to .trivy/ignore-policy.rego instead, which matches on
# the package. (linux-libc-dev is already handled there.)

# Example:
# # justification: false positive — affects only debian buster, we run bookworm. expires 2026-12-31
# CVE-2024-99999
